flowchart TD
  A[A line is heard] --> B([Decider: a claim? what state does it say?])
  B -- yes --> C[Code: which resource, by name]
  C --> D([Decider: which check?])
  D -- no confident check --> X[LLM: route it, optional]
  X --> E
  D --> E[Code: run the check]
  E -- agrees, or can't tell --> Q[Stay quiet]
  E -- contradicts --> F[Code: wait one turn]
  F -- the call fixes it --> Q
  F -- still wrong --> I[LLM agent: second look]
  F -- someone is told to act on it --> P([Decider, on the partial line: act now?])
  P -- yes --> R[Cut in]
  I -- it was right --> Q
  I -- confirmed --> J([Decider: already corrected? finished? + code: speak gate])
  J -- closed --> Q
  J -- open --> K[Say one sentence]
  B -- no --> G([Decider: spoken to? asking the call? finished?])
  G -- neither --> Q
  G -- "spoken to, or nobody answers in 2.5 s" --> L[LLM agent: look it up]
  L --> M[Code: wait for a gap]
  M --> K
  classDef decider fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#1e3a8a
  classDef llm fill:#ffedd5,stroke:#ea580c,color:#7c2d12
  class B,D,P,J,G decider
  class X,I,L llm
